\n→ Contact (nav) → 05_Contact\\n---\\n02_Recipe\\n---\\nGoal: Follow the recipe for Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus.\\n---\\nMUST INCLUDE\\n---\\n• Actions: “PRINT” (Icon_Print) · “SHARE” (Icon_Share)\\n• Directions: “Directions” · 3 steps, each with checkbox, number, title and text; step 1 also has Photo_Cooking_Step (see DATA)\\n• Footer: see DATA (Footer)\\n• Header: Logo_Foodieland · navigation Home / Recipes / Blog / Contact / About us · current: Recipes · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_Instagram\\n• Ingredients: “Ingredients” · “For main dish” 5 items · “For the sauce” 3 items · each with a checkbox · checked: the first main-dish item (Icon_Check) (see DATA)\\n• Intro: one paragraph (see DATA)\\n• Media: Photo_Japanese_Fried_Rice as the recipe video cover · play (Icon_Play)\\n• Meta: Avatar_John_Smith · John Smith · 15 March 2022 · “PREP TIME” 15 Minutes (Icon_Timer) · “COOK TIME” 15 Minutes (Icon_Timer) · Healthy (Icon_Fork_Knife)\\n• Newsletter: “Deliciousness to your inbox” · copy (see DATA) · email field “Your email address...” · “Subscribe” · Decor_Subscribe_Vegetables · Decor_Subscribe_Leaf · Decor_Subscribe_Salad\\n• Nutrition Information: Calories 219.9 kcal · Total Fat 10.7 g · Protein 7.9 g · Carbohydrate 22.3 g · Cholesterol 37.4 mg · note (see DATA)\\n• Other Recipe: “Other Recipe” · Chicken Meatballs with Cream Cheese · The Creamiest Creamy Chicken and Bacon Pasta · The Best Easy One Pot Chicken and Rice, each with photo and “By Andreas Paula”\\n• Promo card: “Don’t forget to eat healthy food” · “www.foodieland.com” · Photo_Ad_Salad\\n• Recommended recipes: “You may like these recipes too” · the first 4 cards of “More recipes” in DATA, each with photo, title, time (Icon_Timer), category (Icon_Fork_Knife) and favorite (Icon_Favorite)\\n• Title: “Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus”\\n---\\nLINKS\\n---\\n→ Home (nav) → 01_Home\\n→ Blog (nav) → 03_Blog\\n---\\n03_Blog\\n---\\nGoal: Find an article to read.\\n---\\nMUST INCLUDE