{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_kzepqsbwwljxcrnmbiuen73nrv2psf4mgpoc7d6xoqfgbqnuzjaq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all 5 Foodieland frames, a library of reusable components and the clickable prototype in **03 · Workspace**. I checked each frame in a screenshot. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were not changed, and the account was confirmed as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai before any edits.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/N0sZy3366tlg36fDtcpHev/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `9:2`\n\n**Screens**\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Home | `14:74` |\n| 02_Recipe | `16:564` |\n| 03_Blog | `17:796` |\n| 04_Blog_Post | `18:943` |\n| 05_Contact | `19:1075` |\n| Components board | `10:32` |\n\n**Design system**\n- **Fixed rules:** Inter throughout, with the two brand colors (#000000 for text and actions, #E7F9FD for the soft tint).\n- **Colors:** I added a color variable set (`Foodieland / Color`, 16 tokens) covering grays, text, borders, favorite red, disabled and error.\n- **Type and layout:** 13 text styles from 64px down to 12px. Content is 1280 wide inside 80px margins.\n- **Media:** every image, logo and icon is an instance from 04 · Media.\n\n**Components (24)**\n- **Reused from 02:** the default Button and Text Field sit inside the newsletter, search bar, form fields and every button.\n- **Built here:** header, footer, nav item, recipe card, category tile, promo card, Instagram post, newsletter card, checkbox, ingredient item, direction step, sidebar item, author, recipe meta, article item, search bar, pagination, form field, select, nutrition panel and buttons.\n- **States:** current nav item, favorited cards, the checked first ingredient, current page 1, and a focused NAME field. There are also hover and disabled states for buttons, nav and pagination, plus an error state for fields.\n\n**Prototype (16 click links, dissolve transition, flow starts at 01_Home)**\n- All required links work:\n  - Fried-rice card on 01, 04 and 05 → 02_Recipe\n  - \"Full Guide…\" article → 04_Blog_Post\n  - Every required nav link (Home, Blog, Contact)\n- Home, Blog and Contact in the nav also link from every other frame. Recipes, About us and the other entry-only items have no links, as the brief specifies.\n\n**Remaining limitations**\n- **Cut-out images aren't transparent.** The decorations and category images in 04 · Media have light, solid backgrounds. On the tint color they showed as boxes, so I cropped the newsletter decorations and category images into circles. The tomato, onion and chef photos use a Darken blend instead, which hides the boxes but not completely.\n- **Unequal card heights:** recipe cards with longer titles are slightly taller than their neighbors.\n- **Message box:** the Text Field from 02 couldn't be resized to a multi-line height through the normal size setting, so its taller look comes from extra padding."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":108588,"cache_read_input_tokens":7696,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":108588,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc46814c-9be1-4e77-972c-23436738df81","uuid":"157d6ee9-0a4f-4d39-9842-a419c9b26d4b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:55:13.385Z"}
